  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="15">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 15</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="15">[Not in D]</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="15[a]" corresp="#wit-k">⁊ ænig man heonan forð cyrican ne þ[e]owige ne cyricmangunge mid unrihte ne macige,</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">And ænig man heonan forð cyrican ne þeowige, ne cyricmangunge mid unrihte ne macige.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-k">And no-one henceforth shall oppress the church, or make it an object of improper traffic,</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">And henceforth no one shall persecute the Church, nor wrongfully make it an object of exchange.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und niemand unterwerfe hinfort eine Kirche einer Dienstpflicht oder treibe gesetzwidrig mit Kirchen Handel</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And let no one henceforth subject a church to servitude, or unlawfully traffic in churches,</ab>
        <note type="editorial">K's ‘þowige’ should be corrected to ‘þeowige’.</note>
        <note type="textual" source="#rabin-doml">þeowige: þowige K</note>
      </div>
    </body>
